{"metadata": {"timestamp": "20260817_t2", "total_runs": 836, "errors": 0, "judge": {"judge_model": "microsoft/phi-4", "judge_provider": "openrouter", "judge_is_local": false, "evaluations": 31, "estimated_cost_usd": 0.0282}, "partial": false, "archivado": "2026-08-18", "motivo": "finish_reason=length · techo de tokens"}, "results": [{"quality": 8.0, "cost_score": 0.14, "cost_usd": 0.415, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 6.45, "test_name": "plan_monetizar_medio_con_restricciones", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 118.9, "latency_first_token": 68.975, "latency_total": 68.975, "input_tokens": 574, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# Plan a $5.000/mes en 90 días\n\nAntes del plan, el veredicto, porque es lo que te hace falta más que el plan:\n\n**Con números conservadores pero realistas, el caso base de este plan llega a ~$4.700/mes en el día 90, no a $5.000.** Te muestro la aritmética completa abajo y verás exactamente dónde se q", "auto_quality": 7.1, "content_score": 5.76, "answer_score": 8.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "reasoning_tokens": 8043, "suite": "business_strategy", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "08a9facddec2", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/business_strategy/plan_monetizar_medio_con_restricciones__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 8.067, "cost_score": 0.17, "cost_usd": 0.408, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 6.497, "test_name": "n8n_workflow_json", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 286.1, "latency_first_token": 28.391, "latency_total": 28.391, "input_tokens": 175, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# Workflow N8N: Clasificador de Mensajes con IA → Slack\n\nAquí tienes el JSON completo, listo para importar (**Workflows → Import from File / Paste JSON**).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Clasificador de Mensajes IA → Slack\",\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"parameters\": {\n        \"httpMethod\": \"POST\",\n        \"path", "auto_quality": 9.34, "content_score": 9.34, "answer_score": 0.0, "scoring": "juez-30-70", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "reasoning_tokens": 2097, "judge_model": "microsoft/phi-4", "judge_provider": "openrouter", "judge_base_url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1", "judge_score": 3.0, "judge_precision": 3, "judge_relevancia": 3, "judge_profundidad": 2, "judge_claridad": 4, "judge_utilidad": 3, "judge_justificacion": "La respuesta es correcta y relevante, pero carece de detalles completos para la clasificación de IA y la lógica de envío a Slack, lo que limita su profundidad y utilidad práctica.", "suite": "code_generation", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "5031075fa6ac", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/code_generation/n8n_workflow_json__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 9.92, "cost_score": 0.217, "cost_usd": 0.394, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 7.8, "test_name": "business_analysis", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 217.5, "latency_first_token": 36.004, "latency_total": 36.004, "input_tokens": 254, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# Análisis SaaS — Q1\n\n**Supuestos que hago** (corrígeme si difieren): usuarios = fin de mes; churn = clientes (no ingresos); LTV/CAC son los que reporta tu herramienta. No tengo margen bruto ni expansión/contracción, así que el NRR lo calculo como GRR.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Métricas clave\n\n| Métrica | Enero |", "auto_quality": 10.0, "content_score": 10.0, "answer_score": 0.0, "scoring": "juez-30-70", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "reasoning_tokens": 4981, "judge_model": "microsoft/phi-4", "judge_provider": "openrouter", "judge_base_url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1", "judge_score": 5, "judge_precision": 5, "judge_relevancia": 5, "judge_profundidad": 5, "judge_claridad": 5, "judge_utilidad": 5, "judge_justificacion": "La respuesta es precisa, relevante, profunda, clara y extremadamente útil, proporcionando un análisis detallado y acciones concretas basadas en los datos.", "suite": "reasoning", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "3ec65a03ca35", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/reasoning/business_analysis__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 9.76, "cost_score": 0.15, "cost_usd": 0.413, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 7.68, "test_name": "curso_emprendimiento_modulo", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 203.733, "latency_first_token": 40.232, "latency_total": 40.232, "input_tokens": 388, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# Módulo 3: Automatización con IA — De la idea al flujo de trabajo\n\n**Curso:** IA Práctica para Emprendedores\n**Duración estimada:** 4 horas (2h teoría + 2h práctica)\n**Nivel:** Emprendedor no técnico\n**Prerrequisitos:** Módulos 1 (Fundamentos de IA generativa) y 2 (Prompting efectivo)\n\n---\n\n## 1. O", "auto_quality": 9.2, "content_score": 9.2, "answer_score": 0.0, "scoring": "juez-30-70", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "judge_model": "microsoft/phi-4", "judge_provider": "openrouter", "judge_base_url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1", "judge_score": 5, "judge_precision": 5, "judge_relevancia": 5, "judge_profundidad": 5, "judge_claridad": 5, "judge_utilidad": 5, "judge_justificacion": "La respuesta es precisa, relevante, profunda, clara y extremadamente útil para un emprendedor, cubriendo todos los aspectos solicitados con ejemplos prácticos y explicaciones detalladas.", "suite": "startup_content", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "4eb53d596835", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/startup_content/curso_emprendimiento_modulo__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 10.0, "cost_score": 0.15, "cost_usd": 0.413, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 7.85, "test_name": "workshop_outline", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 200.5, "latency_first_token": 40.864, "latency_total": 40.864, "input_tokens": 314, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# 🚀 CONSTRUYE TU ASISTENTE DE IA PARA TU STARTUP\n## Workshop Práctico · 3 horas · 20-30 emprendedores no técnicos\n\n**Promesa del workshop (dila en voz alta al empezar):**\n> \"En 180 minutos vas a salir de esta sala con un asistente de IA funcionando, entrenado con la información de TU negocio, resolv", "auto_quality": 10.0, "content_score": 10.0, "answer_score": 0.0, "scoring": "juez-30-70", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "reasoning_tokens": 802, "judge_model": "microsoft/phi-4", "judge_provider": "openrouter", "judge_base_url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1", "judge_score": 5, "judge_precision": 5, "judge_relevancia": 5, "judge_profundidad": 5, "judge_claridad": 5, "judge_utilidad": 5, "judge_justificacion": "La respuesta es precisa, relevante, profunda, clara y extremadamente útil para emprendedores no técnicos, cumpliendo con todos los criterios del ejercicio.", "suite": "startup_content", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "16ccf6b4cc16", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/startup_content/workshop_outline__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 8.973, "cost_score": 0.22, "cost_usd": 0.393, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 7.137, "test_name": "perplexity_style_research", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 198.233, "latency_first_token": 39.349, "latency_total": 39.349, "input_tokens": 297, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# BRIEF DE INVESTIGACIÓN: VC en Latinoamérica — Q1 2026\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ ADVERTENCIA METODOLÓGICA (leer antes de redactar)\n\n**No tengo acceso a datos en vivo ni a información posterior a mi corte de entrenamiento.** El Q1 2026 está fuera de mi alcance verificable. Inventarte cifras de \"inversión total Q1", "auto_quality": 10.0, "content_score": 10.0, "answer_score": 0.0, "scoring": "juez-30-70", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "reasoning_tokens": 2690, "judge_model": "microsoft/phi-4", "judge_provider": "openrouter", "judge_base_url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1", "judge_score": 4.2, "judge_precision": 3, "judge_relevancia": 3, "judge_profundidad": 3, "judge_claridad": 3, "judge_utilidad": 3, "judge_justificacion": "", "suite": "startup_content", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "634e6332b5cc", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/startup_content/perplexity_style_research__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 10.0, "cost_score": 0.39, "cost_usd": 0.348, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 7.883, "test_name": "causal_reasoning", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 220.8, "latency_first_token": 31.186, "latency_total": 31.186, "input_tokens": 315, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# Análisis cuantitativo\n\n## 1. Tabla de métricas derivadas\n\n| Métrica | Mes 1 | Mes 2 | Mes 3 | Patrón |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Pedidos | 1000 | 1200 | 1100 | ↑ luego ↓ |\n| Quejas | 50 | 90 | 110 | ↑ monótono |\n| **Quejas / 1000 pedidos** | **50.0** | **75.0** | **100.0** | **+25 exactos por mes** ", "auto_quality": 9.6, "content_score": 9.0, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "reasoning_tokens": 4844, "suite": "deep_reasoning", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "9aad2e8b356d", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/deep_reasoning/causal_reasoning__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 7.5, "cost_score": 0.15, "cost_usd": 0.413, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 6.1, "test_name": "ethical_dilemma_structured", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 200.367, "latency_first_token": 40.904, "latency_total": 40.904, "input_tokens": 304, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# Recomendación al Board: despliegue del modelo de detección de cáncer\n\n## 0. Primero: los números que me dieron no son suficientes para decidir\n\nAntes del análisis, tengo que señalar que \"95% de precisión\" es una métrica que oculta la decisión real. Necesito saber:\n\n- **¿Sensibilidad o especificida", "auto_quality": 9.6, "content_score": 9.0, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "reasoning_tokens": 3413, "suite": "deep_reasoning", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "e24212a56e80", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/deep_reasoning/ethical_dilemma_structured__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 9.833, "cost_score": 0.16, "cost_usd": 0.412, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 7.733, "test_name": "depth_vs_superficial", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 185.0, "latency_first_token": 44.283, "latency_total": 44.283, "input_tokens": 247, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# Primero: la pregunta está mal formulada\n\n\"Usar IA para mi startup de delivery\" es como decir \"usar electricidad para mi restaurante\". La pregunta útil es: **¿dónde exactamente se fuga la plata en el ciclo de un pedido, y cuál de esas fugas se cierra con predicción?**\n\nPartamos por ahí, porque defi", "auto_quality": 9.74, "content_score": 9.34, "answer_score": 10.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "reasoning_tokens": 5648, "suite": "creativity", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "dbc74f23173a", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/creativity/depth_vs_superficial__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 8.89, "cost_score": 0.15, "cost_usd": 0.412, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 7.07, "test_name": "competitor_analysis", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 198.567, "latency_first_token": 41.263, "latency_total": 41.263, "input_tokens": 274, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# Antes de empezar: qué sé y qué no\n\nVoy a ser explícito con la confiabilidad de cada cosa, porque acá es donde la mayoría de estos análisis fallan.\n\n| Tema | Mi nivel de confianza |\n|---|---|\n| Mailchimp / Brevo: features, modelo de pricing, posicionamiento | **Alto** |\n| Mailchimp / Brevo: cifras ", "auto_quality": 8.0, "content_score": 10.0, "answer_score": 6.67, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "reasoning_tokens": 4365, "suite": "strategy", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "f19a14bc63b8", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/strategy/competitor_analysis__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}, {"quality": 5.833, "cost_score": 0.15, "cost_usd": 0.412, "speed": 10.0, "latency": 1.0, "tool_calling": 7.0, "final": 4.933, "test_name": "pricing_strategy", "model": "Claude Opus 5 Fast", "model_id": "anthropic/claude-opus-5-fast", "success": true, "error": "", "tokens_per_second": 228.533, "latency_first_token": 35.879, "latency_total": 35.879, "input_tokens": 288, "output_tokens": 8192, "response_preview": "# Análisis de pricing: $60 → $89/mes\n\nAntes de los números, tres correcciones a tus datos que cambian las conclusiones:\n\n**a) Tu LTV está inflado ~13%.** $840 usa ingreso, no margen bruto. El cálculo correcto:\n- Margen bruto/usuario = $60 − $8 = **$52/mes**\n- LTV real = $52 / 0.07 = **$743**\n\n**b) T", "auto_quality": 6.68, "content_score": 9.2, "answer_score": 5.0, "scoring": "verificable", "tool_calls_made": 0, "upstream_provider": "Anthropic", "finish_reason": "length", "native_finish_reason": "max_tokens", "reasoning_tokens": 6379, "suite": "strategy", "run": 1, "timestamp": "20260817_t2", "prompt_sha": "823f11888c18", "response_file": "results/responses/claude-opus-5-fast/strategy/pricing_strategy__20260817_t2.md", "runs_averaged": 3}]}